					"doc": "Where in the frame a registered pass runs. Each point is a fixed place in\nSceneRenderer's frame order, the SceneViewExtension idea: a plugin or game\nmodule adds GPU work there without reaching into the renderer.\nAfterGBuffer       the opaque GBuffer (and GPU foliage) is written; nothing lit\nBeforeLighting     decals, AO and RT sun shadows are done; lighting is next\nAfterLighting      direct light, MegaLights, GI, SSGI and SSS are in SceneColor; sky next\nBeforeTranslucency sky, clouds, fog and reflections are in; glass, water and particles next\nAfterTonemap       PostTonemapColor holds the display-encoded image; TAA, lens flare, Final next\nBeforeUI           Output is the presentable image with the editor overlays drawn; UI next",
